{"id":"dudoan-01","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/dudoan-01/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":396.07,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":7.38,"text":"Section 2. You will hear a tour guide talking to some tourists who are going on a walking holiday in Spain.","words":[["Section",0.0,0.46],["2.",0.46,0.98],["You",1.6,2.28],["will",2.28,2.42],["hear",2.42,2.62],["a",2.62,2.82],["tour",2.82,3.08],["guide",3.08,3.5],["talking",3.5,3.92],["to",3.92,4.18],["some",4.18,4.38],["tourists",4.38,4.82],["who",4.82,5.18],["are",5.18,5.26],["going",5.26,5.5],["on",5.5,5.76],["a",5.76,5.88],["walking",5.88,6.22],["holiday",6.22,6.7],["in",6.7,7.02],["Spain.",7.02,7.38]]},{"start":8.56,"end":14.12,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 11 to 14 on page 3.","words":[["First",8.56,9.24],["you",9.24,9.46],["have",9.46,9.62],["some",9.62,9.8],["time",9.8,10.18],["to",10.18,10.46],["look",10.46,10.58],["at",10.58,10.72],["questions",10.72,11.06],["11",11.06,11.56],["to",11.56,11.8],["14",11.8,12.32],["on",12.32,13.26],["page",13.26,13.6],["3.",13.6,14.12]]},{"start":39.44,"end":43.28,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 14.","words":[["Now",39.44,39.84],["listen",39.84,40.2],["carefully",40.2,40.66],["and",40.66,41.06],["answer",41.06,41.54],["questions",41.54,41.96],["11",41.96,42.56],["to",42.56,42.78],["14.",42.78,43.28]]},{"start":47.0,"end":53.04,"text":"Well, good evening everyone. My name's Gary Payne and I'll be the leader for your walking holiday in Spain.","words":[["Well,",47.0,47.54],["good",47.6,47.72],["evening",47.72,48.0],["everyone.",48.0,48.36],["My",48.94,49.2],["name's",49.2,49.54],["Gary",49.54,49.74],["Payne",49.74,50.34],["and",50.34,50.6],["I'll",50.6,50.88],["be",50.88,51.0],["the",51.0,51.2],["leader",51.2,51.4],["for",51.4,51.56],["your",51.56,51.72],["walking",51.72,52.06],["holiday",52.06,52.4],["in",52.4,52.68],["Spain.",52.68,53.04]]},{"start":53.56,"end":56.74,"text":"and the purpose of this evening's meeting is for us all to get to know each","words":[["and",53.56,54.0],["the",54.0,54.14],["purpose",54.14,54.38],["of",54.38,54.58],["this",54.58,54.72],["evening's",54.72,55.1],["meeting",55.1,55.3],["is",55.3,55.68],["for",55.68,55.82],["us",55.82,55.9],["all",55.9,56.04],["to",56.04,56.16],["get",56.16,56.26],["to",56.26,56.44],["know",56.44,56.6],["each",56.6,56.74]]},{"start":56.74,"end":60.64,"text":"other in advance and for you to ask any questions you may have about the holiday.","words":[["other",56.74,56.94],["in",56.94,57.08],["advance",57.08,57.44],["and",57.44,58.2],["for",58.2,58.34],["you",58.34,58.44],["to",58.44,58.54],["ask",58.54,58.74],["any",58.74,58.94],["questions",58.94,59.34],["you",59.34,59.66],["may",59.66,59.78],["have",59.78,60.0],["about",60.0,60.2],["the",60.2,60.34],["holiday.",60.34,60.64]]},{"start":61.5,"end":66.9,"text":"So I'll begin by telling you a little bit about what to expect. Now the ferry","words":[["So",61.5,61.94],["I'll",61.94,62.36],["begin",62.36,62.64],["by",62.64,63.22],["telling",63.22,63.58],["you",63.58,63.78],["a",63.78,63.92],["little",63.92,64.06],["bit",64.06,64.2],["about",64.2,64.4],["what",64.4,64.54],["to",64.54,64.68],["expect.",64.68,65.0],["Now",66.2,66.48],["the",66.48,66.64],["ferry",66.64,66.9]]},{"start":66.9,"end":72.14,"text":"crossing from England to Santander in Spain takes about 24 hours. We'll be","words":[["crossing",66.9,67.26],["from",67.26,67.54],["England",67.54,67.74],["to",67.74,68.04],["Santander",68.04,68.46],["in",68.46,68.78],["Spain",68.78,69.08],["takes",69.08,69.6],["about",69.6,69.92],["24",69.92,70.44],["hours.",70.44,70.92],["We'll",71.6,72.04],["be",72.04,72.14]]},{"start":72.14,"end":76.76,"text":"sailing on the Prince Regent, which was first launched in the 1980s. As well as","words":[["sailing",72.14,72.46],["on",72.46,72.76],["the",72.76,72.92],["Prince",72.92,73.14],["Regent,",73.14,73.5],["which",73.78,73.96],["was",73.96,74.1],["first",74.1,74.28],["launched",74.28,74.56],["in",74.56,74.76],["the",74.76,74.84],["1980s.",74.84,75.8],["As",76.02,76.42],["well",76.42,76.62],["as",76.62,76.76]]},{"start":76.76,"end":84.12,"text":"As the crew of 160, it can accommodate about 2,000 people and 600 cars, and it sails at","words":[["As",76.76,76.76],["the",76.76,76.88],["crew",76.88,77.12],["of",77.12,77.26],["160,",77.26,77.9],["it",78.46,78.66],["can",78.66,78.76],["accommodate",78.76,79.12],["about",79.12,79.46],["2",79.46,79.8],[",000",79.8,80.26],["people",80.26,80.66],["and",80.66,81.36],["600",81.36,81.78],["cars,",81.78,82.44],["and",83.2,83.48],["it",83.48,83.6],["sails",83.6,84.0],["at",84.0,84.12]]},{"start":84.12,"end":86.56,"text":"an average speed of 37 km an hour.","words":[["an",84.12,84.24],["average",84.24,84.46],["speed",84.46,84.9],["of",84.9,85.14],["37",85.14,85.5],["km",85.5,85.94],["an",85.94,86.34],["hour.",86.34,86.56]]},{"start":87.14,"end":91.46,"text":"There'll be an onboard map on one of the decks, which charts the ship's progress during","words":[["There'll",87.14,87.54],["be",87.54,87.62],["an",87.62,87.72],["onboard",87.72,87.96],["map",87.96,88.42],["on",88.42,88.72],["one",88.72,88.9],["of",88.9,89.0],["the",89.0,89.1],["decks,",89.1,89.3],["which",89.8,89.98],["charts",89.98,90.28],["the",90.28,90.52],["ship's",90.52,90.76],["progress",90.76,91.08],["during",91.08,91.46]]},{"start":91.46,"end":91.86,"text":"the voyage.","words":[["the",91.46,91.6],["voyage.",91.6,91.86]]},{"start":92.98,"end":97.28,"text":"Although our mini bus will be on one of the vehicle decks in the boat, access to","words":[["Although",92.98,93.46],["our",93.46,93.7],["mini",93.7,93.88],["bus",93.88,94.12],["will",94.12,94.48],["be",94.48,94.72],["on",94.72,94.92],["one",94.92,95.1],["of",95.1,95.26],["the",95.26,95.32],["vehicle",95.32,95.54],["decks",95.54,95.9],["in",95.9,96.08],["the",96.08,96.18],["boat,",96.18,96.38],["access",96.78,97.02],["to",97.02,97.28]]},{"start":97.28,"end":101.36,"text":"these decks is prohibited during the crossing, so when you leave our bus, you'll have","words":[["these",97.28,97.46],["decks",97.46,97.74],["is",97.74,97.96],["prohibited",97.96,98.3],["during",98.3,98.7],["the",98.7,98.86],["crossing,",98.86,99.2],["so",99.5,99.8],["when",99.8,100.0],["you",100.0,100.12],["leave",100.12,100.4],["our",100.4,100.6],["bus,",100.6,100.84],["you'll",101.1,101.22],["have",101.22,101.36]]},{"start":101.36,"end":105.3,"text":"to take everything that you're likely to need with you, like toiletries or books","words":[["to",101.36,101.46],["take",101.46,101.64],["everything",101.64,102.0],["that",102.0,102.24],["you're",102.24,102.38],["likely",102.38,102.52],["to",102.52,102.7],["need",102.7,102.98],["with",102.98,103.28],["you,",103.28,103.54],["like",103.7,103.98],["toiletries",103.98,104.62],["or",104.62,104.96],["books",104.96,105.3]]},{"start":105.3,"end":109.96,"text":"books and magazines. In fact, it's probably a good idea to put these things in a separate","words":[["books",105.3,105.4],["and",105.4,105.5],["magazines.",105.5,105.9],["In",106.84,107.06],["fact,",107.06,107.38],["it's",107.48,107.66],["probably",107.66,107.98],["a",107.98,108.14],["good",108.14,108.26],["idea",108.26,108.56],["to",108.56,108.74],["put",108.74,108.88],["these",108.88,109.12],["things",109.12,109.4],["in",109.4,109.54],["a",109.54,109.66],["separate",109.66,109.96]]},{"start":109.96,"end":115.34,"text":"bag beforehand. You shouldn't need snacks on board as meals are provided and they're","words":[["bag",109.96,110.34],["beforehand.",110.34,110.76],["You",111.84,112.14],["shouldn't",112.14,112.48],["need",112.48,112.72],["snacks",112.72,113.02],["on",113.02,113.32],["board",113.32,113.6],["as",113.6,113.84],["meals",113.84,114.02],["are",114.02,114.2],["provided",114.2,114.62],["and",114.62,115.0],["they're",115.0,115.34]]},{"start":115.34,"end":120.08,"text":"quite substantial. And if you don't feel well or get a headache, you can get tablets","words":[["quite",115.34,115.56],["substantial.",115.56,116.2],["And",116.76,117.26],["if",117.26,117.38],["you",117.38,117.48],["don't",117.48,117.66],["feel",117.66,117.88],["well",117.88,118.22],["or",118.22,118.42],["get",118.42,118.64],["a",118.64,118.74],["headache,",118.74,118.98],["you",119.34,119.48],["can",119.48,119.62],["get",119.62,119.74],["tablets",119.74,120.08]]},{"start":120.08,"end":122.64,"text":"from me. I always carry an adequate supply.","words":[["from",120.08,120.34],["me.",120.34,120.56],["I",121.0,121.28],["always",121.28,121.54],["carry",121.54,121.8],["an",121.8,121.98],["adequate",121.98,122.22],["supply.",122.22,122.64]]},{"start":123.64,"end":128.96,"text":"Now once we're in Spain, we'll be based at a hostel in a small village called La Vega","words":[["Now",123.64,124.16],["once",124.16,124.42],["we're",124.42,124.66],["in",124.66,124.8],["Spain,",124.8,125.18],["we'll",125.5,125.72],["be",125.72,125.82],["based",125.82,126.1],["at",126.1,126.24],["a",126.24,126.32],["hostel",126.32,126.66],["in",126.66,126.92],["a",126.92,127.04],["small",127.04,127.3],["village",127.3,127.62],["called",127.62,128.12],["La",128.12,128.6],["Vega",128.6,128.96]]},{"start":128.96,"end":135.74,"text":"Via de Libana, about 120 km from Santander. It's a very picturesque area that's retained","words":[["Via",128.96,129.08],["de",129.08,129.38],["Libana,",129.38,129.82],["about",130.3,130.46],["120",130.46,131.2],["km",131.2,131.44],["from",131.44,131.86],["Santander.",131.86,132.38],["It's",133.08,133.58],["a",133.58,133.68],["very",133.68,134.04],["picturesque",134.04,134.72],["area",134.72,135.02],["that's",135.02,135.48],["retained",135.48,135.74]]},{"start":135.74,"end":141.36,"text":"a lot of its traditional industry and culture. The hostel accommodation is fairly simple.","words":[["a",135.74,135.94],["lot",135.94,136.12],["of",136.12,136.26],["its",136.26,136.42],["traditional",136.42,136.82],["industry",136.82,137.42],["and",137.42,137.62],["culture.",137.62,138.0],["The",139.06,139.3],["hostel",139.3,139.52],["accommodation",139.52,139.88],["is",139.88,140.54],["fairly",140.54,140.96],["simple.",140.96,141.36]]},{"start":141.92,"end":147.64,"text":"There are bunk beds, and each room holds four to eight people. But the bathrooms and showers","words":[["There",141.92,142.04],["are",142.04,142.16],["bunk",142.16,142.42],["beds,",142.42,142.82],["and",143.08,143.24],["each",143.24,143.5],["room",143.5,143.8],["holds",143.8,144.2],["four",144.2,144.72],["to",144.72,144.96],["eight",144.96,145.18],["people.",145.18,145.56],["But",146.02,146.34],["the",146.34,146.54],["bathrooms",146.54,146.88],["and",146.88,147.3],["showers",147.3,147.64]]},{"start":147.64,"end":153.08,"text":"are of a high standard. The hostel residents have the use of tennis courts nearby, if","words":[["are",147.64,147.96],["of",147.96,148.08],["a",148.08,148.16],["high",148.16,148.34],["standard.",148.34,148.76],["The",149.54,149.82],["hostel",149.82,150.06],["residents",150.06,150.42],["have",150.42,151.02],["the",151.02,151.24],["use",151.24,151.46],["of",151.46,151.7],["tennis",151.7,151.92],["courts",151.92,152.24],["nearby,",152.24,152.62],["if",152.98,153.08]]},{"start":153.08,"end":157.32,"text":"you feel like a game. We'll be given breakfast and an evening meal at the hostel.","words":[["you",153.08,153.2],["feel",153.2,153.34],["like",153.34,153.54],["a",153.54,153.66],["game.",153.66,153.86],["We'll",154.42,154.86],["be",154.86,154.96],["given",154.96,155.16],["breakfast",155.16,155.54],["and",155.54,156.0],["an",156.0,156.16],["evening",156.16,156.3],["meal",156.3,156.64],["at",156.64,156.82],["the",156.82,156.98],["hostel.",156.98,157.32]]},{"start":157.32,"end":162.98,"text":"hostel. In general, the hostel is relaxed, but there are a few rules which the owners","words":[["hostel.",157.32,157.44],["In",158.3,158.86],["general,",158.86,159.18],["the",159.38,159.42],["hostel",159.42,159.68],["is",159.68,160.04],["relaxed,",160.04,160.68],["but",161.08,161.32],["there",161.32,161.46],["are",161.46,161.6],["a",161.6,161.74],["few",161.74,161.9],["rules",161.9,162.26],["which",162.26,162.56],["the",162.56,162.7],["owners",162.7,162.98]]},{"start":162.98,"end":169.98,"text":"enforce strictly. Smoking is not allowed anywhere inside the building, and food and drink is","words":[["enforce",162.98,163.44],["strictly.",163.44,164.22],["Smoking",164.9,165.4],["is",165.4,165.78],["not",165.78,166.02],["allowed",166.02,166.4],["anywhere",166.4,167.02],["inside",167.02,167.78],["the",167.78,168.0],["building,",168.0,168.28],["and",168.64,169.06],["food",169.06,169.36],["and",169.36,169.52],["drink",169.52,169.78],["is",169.78,169.98]]},{"start":169.98,"end":175.54,"text":"banned in the dormitories. Any chairs or tables which you take outside into the gardens must","words":[["banned",169.98,170.26],["in",170.26,170.46],["the",170.46,170.56],["dormitories.",170.56,171.04],["Any",171.86,172.26],["chairs",172.26,172.64],["or",172.64,172.84],["tables",172.84,173.24],["which",173.24,173.52],["you",173.52,173.66],["take",173.66,173.8],["outside",173.8,174.3],["into",174.3,174.54],["the",174.54,174.66],["gardens",174.66,175.0],["must",175.0,175.54]]},{"start":175.54,"end":180.54,"text":"be returned every evening to their original place. And finally, the doors are locked","words":[["be",175.54,175.72],["returned",175.72,176.1],["every",176.1,176.48],["evening",176.48,176.86],["to",176.86,177.12],["their",177.12,177.26],["original",177.26,177.62],["place.",177.62,178.02],["And",178.76,179.06],["finally,",179.06,179.42],["the",179.84,179.94],["doors",179.94,180.18],["are",180.18,180.36],["locked",180.36,180.54]]},{"start":180.54,"end":184.38,"text":"after midnight out of consideration for other guests who are trying to sleep.","words":[["after",180.54,180.84],["midnight",180.84,181.18],["out",181.18,181.7],["of",181.7,181.8],["consideration",181.8,182.18],["for",182.18,182.6],["other",182.6,182.74],["guests",182.74,183.08],["who",183.08,183.7],["are",183.7,183.78],["trying",183.78,183.98],["to",183.98,184.14],["sleep.",184.14,184.38]]},{"start":184.38,"end":194.59,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 15 to 20 on","words":[["Before",184.38,185.46],["you",188.43,188.81],["hear",188.81,189.07],["the",189.07,189.27],["rest",189.27,189.51],["of",189.51,189.63],["the",189.63,189.71],["talk,",189.71,190.01],["you",190.47,190.65],["have",190.65,190.85],["some",190.85,191.03],["time",191.03,191.47],["to",191.47,191.75],["look",191.75,191.87],["at",191.87,192.01],["questions",192.01,192.33],["15",192.33,193.17],["to",193.17,193.39],["20",193.39,193.81],["on",193.81,194.59]]},{"start":194.59,"end":224.27,"text":"page 4. Now listen and answer questions 15 to 20.","words":[["page",194.59,194.93],["4.",194.93,195.47],["Now",220.81,221.09],["listen",221.09,221.43],["and",221.43,221.85],["answer",221.85,222.27],["questions",222.27,222.73],["15",222.73,223.61],["to",223.61,223.85],["20.",223.85,224.27]]},{"start":227.67,"end":233.09,"text":"Now that's enough about travel and accommodation. But before I move on, I should say something","words":[["Now",227.67,228.17],["that's",228.17,228.47],["enough",228.47,228.63],["about",228.63,228.93],["travel",228.93,229.31],["and",229.31,229.55],["accommodation.",229.55,230.07],["But",230.55,230.89],["before",230.89,231.21],["I",231.21,231.41],["move",231.41,231.55],["on,",231.55,231.87],["I",232.09,232.21],["should",232.21,232.41],["say",232.41,232.73],["something",232.73,233.09]]},{"start":233.09,"end":237.95,"text":"briefly about equipment. There's a list in the guidebook you've been sent, but I'll","words":[["briefly",233.09,233.55],["about",233.55,233.97],["equipment.",233.97,234.45],["There's",235.25,235.83],["a",235.83,235.93],["list",235.93,236.11],["in",236.11,236.27],["the",236.27,236.35],["guidebook",236.35,236.73],["you've",236.73,236.97],["been",236.97,237.09],["sent,",237.09,237.39],["but",237.63,237.77],["I'll",237.77,237.95]]},{"start":237.95,"end":244.67,"text":"just elaborate on one or two items. First, boots. Make sure that the ones you bring","words":[["just",237.95,238.05],["elaborate",238.05,238.41],["on",238.41,238.79],["one",238.79,239.01],["or",239.01,239.13],["two",239.13,239.41],["items.",239.41,239.81],["First,",240.59,241.09],["boots.",241.75,242.05],["Make",242.93,243.19],["sure",243.19,243.61],["that",243.61,243.85],["the",243.85,243.97],["ones",243.97,244.15],["you",244.15,244.41],["bring",244.41,244.67]]},{"start":244.67,"end":249.81,"text":"have thick soles, that's the most important thing. Don't bring trainers for walking","words":[["have",244.67,244.87],["thick",244.87,245.21],["soles,",245.21,245.85],["that's",245.99,246.25],["the",246.25,246.37],["most",246.37,246.71],["important",246.71,247.19],["thing.",247.19,247.53],["Don't",248.31,248.75],["bring",248.75,248.89],["trainers",248.89,249.31],["for",249.31,249.55],["walking",249.55,249.81]]},{"start":249.81,"end":254.81,"text":"in, apart from anything else they're dangerous because they slip. It's important to bring","words":[["in,",249.81,250.09],["apart",250.35,250.57],["from",250.57,250.75],["anything",250.75,250.93],["else",250.93,251.17],["they're",251.17,251.41],["dangerous",251.41,251.71],["because",251.71,252.01],["they",252.01,252.19],["slip.",252.19,252.51],["It's",253.51,253.77],["important",253.77,254.19],["to",254.19,254.63],["bring",254.63,254.81]]},{"start":254.81,"end":261.33,"text":"spare socks. Then, about waterproofs. I'd strongly advise you not to come with anything","words":[["spare",254.81,255.25],["socks.",255.25,255.71],["Then,",256.83,257.11],["about",257.51,257.73],["waterproofs.",257.73,258.57],["I'd",258.81,259.19],["strongly",259.19,259.57],["advise",259.57,259.99],["you",259.99,260.21],["not",260.21,260.37],["to",260.37,260.59],["come",260.59,260.85],["with",260.85,261.07],["anything",261.07,261.33]]},{"start":261.33,"end":266.75,"text":"heavy, you know, with a thick lining. The ideal things are those lightweight ones because","words":[["heavy,",261.33,261.77],["you",262.13,262.21],["know,",262.21,262.35],["with",262.45,262.57],["a",262.57,262.67],["thick",262.67,262.87],["lining.",262.87,263.27],["The",263.87,264.07],["ideal",264.07,264.47],["things",264.47,264.89],["are",264.89,265.21],["those",265.21,265.41],["lightweight",265.41,265.81],["ones",265.81,266.23],["because",266.23,266.75]]},{"start":266.75,"end":270.51,"text":"they fold up small and although they do keep the wind out, they don't make you","words":[["they",266.75,266.93],["fold",266.93,267.15],["up",267.15,267.33],["small",267.33,267.65],["and",267.65,268.15],["although",268.15,268.41],["they",268.41,268.61],["do",268.61,268.77],["keep",268.77,268.99],["the",268.99,269.15],["wind",269.15,269.33],["out,",269.33,269.61],["they",269.87,269.97],["don't",269.97,270.21],["make",270.21,270.37],["you",270.37,270.51]]},{"start":270.51,"end":278.87,"text":"too hot, right? Next, sun cream. This is absolutely essential. And regarding the strength, make","words":[["too",270.51,270.65],["hot,",270.65,270.93],["right?",271.21,271.81],["Next,",272.75,273.27],["sun",273.91,274.07],["cream.",274.07,274.51],["This",274.87,275.03],["is",275.03,275.19],["absolutely",275.19,275.93],["essential.",275.93,276.53],["And",277.15,277.29],["regarding",277.29,277.61],["the",277.61,277.85],["strength,",277.85,278.21],["make",278.61,278.87]]},{"start":278.87,"end":284.95,"text":"sure you get what's known as total block. Even factor 25 isn't good enough for those","words":[["sure",278.87,279.23],["you",279.23,279.41],["get",279.41,279.55],["what's",279.55,279.85],["known",279.85,280.05],["as",280.05,280.35],["total",280.35,281.13],["block.",281.13,281.89],["Even",282.71,283.05],["factor",283.05,283.35],["25",283.35,283.87],["isn't",283.87,284.25],["good",284.25,284.39],["enough",284.39,284.59],["for",284.59,284.75],["those",284.75,284.95]]},{"start":284.95,"end":291.57,"text":"latitudes in July. Then, let's see, bring a folder to keep your map and other papers","words":[["latitudes",284.95,285.43],["in",285.43,285.89],["July.",285.89,286.19],["Then,",287.21,287.67],["let's",287.93,288.47],["see,",288.47,288.63],["bring",289.01,289.21],["a",289.21,289.37],["folder",289.37,289.83],["to",289.83,290.11],["keep",290.11,290.27],["your",290.27,290.45],["map",290.45,290.81],["and",290.81,291.03],["other",291.03,291.21],["papers",291.21,291.57]]},{"start":291.57,"end":296.3,"text":"in, you know, one of those plastic ones. It's not very likely to rain, but if it","words":[["in,",291.57,291.85],["you",291.97,292.09],["know,",292.09,292.19],["one",292.25,292.37],["of",292.37,292.49],["those",292.49,292.75],["plastic",292.75,293.23],["ones.",293.23,293.55],["It's",294.13,294.53],["not",294.53,294.69],["very",294.69,294.93],["likely",294.93,295.23],["to",295.23,295.39],["rain,",295.39,295.69],["but",295.75,295.91],["if",295.91,296.01],["it",296.01,296.3]]},{"start":296.3,"end":303.2,"text":"you'll find it soaks everything. So that's the practicalities over. Now let me tell","words":[["you'll",296.3,297.18],["find",297.18,297.36],["it",297.36,297.52],["soaks",297.52,298.06],["everything.",298.06,298.48],["So",299.6,300.06],["that's",300.06,300.48],["the",300.48,300.64],["practicalities",300.64,301.48],["over.",301.48,301.74],["Now",302.54,302.74],["let",302.74,302.9],["me",302.9,303.0],["tell",303.0,303.2]]},{"start":303.2,"end":307.86,"text":"you a little bit about the area in Spain where we'll be walking, the Picos de Europa.","words":[["you",303.2,303.32],["a",303.32,303.44],["little",303.44,303.6],["bit",303.6,303.8],["about",303.8,303.98],["the",303.98,304.18],["area",304.18,304.44],["in",304.44,304.7],["Spain",304.7,305.02],["where",305.02,305.5],["we'll",305.5,305.68],["be",305.68,305.78],["walking,",305.78,306.1],["the",306.74,306.82],["Picos",306.82,307.12],["de",307.12,307.56],["Europa.",307.56,307.86]]},{"start":308.78,"end":313.58,"text":"It's a very popular area for tourists because of its spectacular peaks. Although","words":[["It's",308.78,308.98],["a",308.98,309.08],["very",309.08,309.3],["popular",309.3,309.66],["area",309.66,310.06],["for",310.06,310.22],["tourists",310.22,310.58],["because",310.58,311.14],["of",311.14,311.3],["its",311.3,311.4],["spectacular",311.4,311.92],["peaks.",311.92,312.46],["Although",313.16,313.58]]},{"start":313.58,"end":318.74,"text":"they're only 25 kilometers from the sea, the highest peaks are more than 2,600","words":[["they're",313.58,313.84],["only",313.84,314.06],["25",314.06,314.52],["kilometers",314.52,314.84],["from",314.84,315.22],["the",315.22,315.34],["sea,",315.34,315.6],["the",315.94,316.04],["highest",316.04,316.32],["peaks",316.32,316.68],["are",316.68,316.96],["more",316.96,317.08],["than",317.08,317.28],["2",317.28,317.66],[",600",317.66,318.74]]},{"start":318.74,"end":324.5,"text":"meters high and have year-round snow caps. On the highest peaks you've got","words":[["meters",318.74,319.34],["high",319.34,319.84],["and",319.84,320.54],["have",320.54,320.68],["year",320.68,320.96],["-round",320.96,321.28],["snow",321.28,321.58],["caps.",321.58,321.94],["On",322.76,322.96],["the",322.96,323.1],["highest",323.1,323.36],["peaks",323.36,323.76],["you've",323.76,324.38],["got",324.38,324.5]]},{"start":324.5,"end":330.56,"text":"alpine plants that are only free of their snow cover for a few months a year. Then you've","words":[["alpine",324.5,325.0],["plants",325.0,325.46],["that",325.46,325.76],["are",325.76,325.88],["only",325.88,326.18],["free",326.18,326.48],["of",326.48,326.64],["their",326.64,326.78],["snow",326.78,327.04],["cover",327.04,327.4],["for",327.4,327.86],["a",327.86,328.02],["few",328.02,328.28],["months",328.28,328.62],["a",328.62,328.82],["year.",328.82,329.1],["Then",329.82,330.28],["you've",330.28,330.56]]},{"start":330.56,"end":335.16,"text":"got meadows that are full of wild flowers at certain times of the year. Then the northern","words":[["got",330.56,330.74],["meadows",330.74,331.12],["that",331.12,331.52],["are",331.52,331.64],["full",331.64,331.8],["of",331.8,331.92],["wild",331.92,332.18],["flowers",332.18,332.6],["at",332.6,332.82],["certain",332.82,333.06],["times",333.06,333.38],["of",333.38,333.54],["the",333.54,333.62],["year.",333.62,333.92],["Then",334.46,334.76],["the",334.76,334.9],["northern",334.9,335.16]]},{"start":335.16,"end":340.7,"text":"slopes are covered by woodlands, giving homes to rare species such as wolves and bears.","words":[["slopes",335.16,335.56],["are",335.56,336.1],["covered",336.1,336.28],["by",336.28,336.52],["woodlands,",336.52,337.1],["giving",337.48,337.72],["homes",337.72,338.1],["to",338.1,338.3],["rare",338.3,338.54],["species",338.54,338.96],["such",338.96,339.44],["as",339.44,339.66],["wolves",339.66,340.08],["and",340.08,340.4],["bears.",340.4,340.7]]},{"start":341.64,"end":345.82,"text":"And because of the variety of plant life, which survives in that part of Europe due","words":[["And",341.64,341.96],["because",341.96,342.22],["of",342.22,342.46],["the",342.46,342.54],["variety",342.54,342.84],["of",342.84,343.04],["plant",343.04,343.3],["life,",343.3,343.68],["which",343.98,344.14],["survives",344.14,344.46],["in",344.46,344.68],["that",344.68,344.82],["part",344.82,345.02],["of",345.02,345.18],["Europe",345.18,345.4],["due",345.4,345.82]]},{"start":345.82,"end":355.1,"text":"to the traditional way of life there, that is the end of section two. You now have","words":[["to",345.82,345.92],["the",345.92,346.04],["traditional",346.04,346.34],["way",346.34,346.62],["of",346.62,346.72],["life",346.72,347.02],["there,",347.02,347.32],["that",351.34,351.68],["is",351.68,351.86],["the",351.86,352.02],["end",352.02,352.44],["of",352.44,352.64],["section",352.64,352.9],["two.",352.9,353.42],["You",354.12,354.4],["now",354.4,354.7],["have",354.7,355.1]]},{"start":355.1,"end":390.81,"text":"half a minute to check your answers. Now turn to section 3 on page 5.","words":[["half",355.1,355.36],["a",355.36,355.58],["minute",355.58,355.82],["to",355.82,356.12],["check",356.12,356.44],["your",356.44,356.62],["answers.",356.62,357.06],["Now",387.35,387.79],["turn",387.79,388.09],["to",388.09,388.29],["section",388.29,388.55],["3",388.55,389.19],["on",389.19,389.89],["page",389.89,390.23],["5.",390.23,390.81]]}]}